flowchart-diagram

// Entry Point
HomePage [shape: oval, icon: home, color: purple]
// Player Setup
Enter Name [shape: parallelogram, icon: edit]
Choose Avatar [shape: parallelogram, icon: user]

// Room Actions
Room Action? [shape: diamond, icon: help-circle]

Create Room Path [color: green] {
    Create Room [icon: plus-circle, color: green]
    Room Created [icon: check-circle]
    Get Room Code [shape: parallelogram, icon: hash]
}

Join Room Path [color: blue] {
    Join Room [icon: log-in, color: blue]
    Enter Room Code [shape: parallelogram, icon: key]
    Room Exists? [shape: diamond, icon: search]
    Room Full? [shape: diamond, icon: users]
    Error [shape: oval, icon: alert-triangle, color: red]
}

// Lobby
Lobby [icon: layout, color: orange] {
    Waiting Room [icon: clock]
    Host Settings [icon: settings]
    Player List [icon: users]
    Is Game Playing? [shape: diamond, icon: play]
}

// Game Loop
Game Screen [icon: monitor, color: green] {
    Pick Drawer [icon: pen-tool]
    Select Word [icon: book]
    Send Word to Drawer [icon: eye]
    Send Hint to Guessers [icon: eye-off]
    Start Timer [icon: clock]
}

Turn Loop [color: blue] {
    Drawing Phase [icon: pen-tool, color: blue]
    Player Guesses [icon: message-circle]
    Correct? [shape: diamond, icon: check]
    Award Points [icon: award]
    Timer Done? [shape: diamond, icon: clock]
    Time Up [icon: alert-circle]
}

Round Check [color: orange] {
    Next Drawer? [shape: diamond, icon: skip-forward]
    Next Round? [shape: diamond, icon: repeat]
}

Game Over [shape: oval, icon: trophy, color: red]
Show Scoreboard [shape: oval, icon: bar-chart-2]

// Flow: Entry
HomePage > Enter Name > Choose Avatar > Room Action?

// Flow: Create Room
Room Action? > Create Room: Create
Create Room > Room Created > Get Room Code > Waiting Room

// Flow: Join Room
Room Action? > Join Room: Join
Join Room > Enter Room Code > Room Exists?
Room Exists? > Error: No
Room Exists? > Room Full?: Yes
Room Full? > Error: Yes
Room Full? > Is Game Playing?: No

// Flow: Lobby to Game
Is Game Playing? > Game Screen: Yes (Skip Lobby)
Is Game Playing? > Waiting Room: No
Waiting Room > Host Settings
Host Settings > Player List
Player List > Game Screen: Host Starts

// Flow: Game Turn
Game Screen > Pick Drawer > Select Word
Select Word > Send Word to Drawer
Select Word > Send Hint to Guessers
Send Hint to Guessers > Start Timer > Drawing Phase

// Flow: Guessing
Drawing Phase > Player Guesses > Correct?
Correct? > Award Points: Yes
Correct? > Player Guesses: No (Show in Chat)
Award Points > Next Drawer?
Timer Done? > Time Up > Next Drawer?

// Flow: Round Management
Next Drawer? > Pick Drawer: Yes (More Players)
Next Drawer? > Next Round?: No (All Drew)
Next Round? > Pick Drawer: Yes (Rounds Left)
Next Round? > Game Over: No (All Done)
Game Over > Show Scoreboard